cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or the workbook, please cite the paper (preferred-citation) and this package."
type: dataset
title: "Ukrainian agri-food digital maturity against new EU member states: replication package"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for the paper "Ukrainian agri-food digital maturity against new EU member states".
  It contains the original API responses of Eurostat (Integrated Farm Statistics 2023; ICT usage in
  enterprises, NACE C10-C12) and of the State Statistics Service of Ukraine (2025), the derived tables, and
  an Excel workbook in which every number reported in the paper is a live formula over the official values:
  farm-level technology shares and partial layer scores, the ADMI digital maturity index of food processing
  for nine Central and Eastern European EU member states and Ukraine, maturity levels, TOPSIS and min-max
  checks, and the sensitivity of the ranking to the penalty parameters, the aggregation rule, the indicator
  set and the year alignment.
